ntents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Instructions: Complete the following steps. Fill in the Self Assessment."}]}], "template_override": 1}], "id": 0, "type": "scholar", "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "id": 0, "contents": [{}]}, {"id": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": [], "template_override": 1, "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn5le10ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn5le10ob04re2img06.jpg", "images": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "", "image": "engenn5le10ob04re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Hey, Peter. Have you started your new accounting course?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Yes. It's interesting. It seems to be both online and coursework.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: What do you mean? Computer programing? I can't stand IT stuff.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn5le10ob04re2img06.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: No, we have to contribute to online discussions and work with partners. I have to use my Webcam.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh, I see. Are you marked on your participation?<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I think so.  I've been busy researching math notions all afternoon.  It's a bit overwhelming!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: You sound a bit stunned. I hope it's worth it.  You're either working or studying now. You never come over.", "id": 2, "time": "15000", "image": "engenn5le10ob04re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Well, it's the best and cheapest fit for me. It might give an advantage in the job market.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: I hope it pays off.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: I have big dreams, Sally.  I want to be retired by 55.<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Sally</span>: Oh Peter, you'll need to make some big bucks!<br />\n<span class =\"strong\">Peter</span>: Tell me about it! I won't be looking back.", "id": 3, "time": "38000", "image": "engenn5le10ob04re2img05.jpg"}]}}]}]}], "_data": [{"type": "metadata", "contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Peter Prepares for Final Exams"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "A Whole New World"}, {"type": "position", "content": 4}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 10}, {"type": "level", "content": "A2.2"}]}, {"type": "achievment_test", "contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}]}, {"type": "objectives", "contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Accurately use information about people's jobs and places of work in communicative situations"}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies the expressions and vocabulary necessary for the description of places of work and jobs in common written and spoken situations"}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands important information and aspects of attitude and intention in spoken situations in English on a range of common communicative topics related to this level"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "The Sound /t/ Between Consonants"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " "}, {"type": "text", "content": "There are 4 different ways to pronounce the <span class=\"italic\">t</span> sound."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Sound 1: True t sound </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"italic\">t</span> is a regular sound when it is the first sound of a word or a stressed syllable. This rule overrides all rules below. The <span class=\"italic\">t sound</span> is transcribed as /t/."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: attach, pretend, italics, started"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Sound 2: Quick d sound </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The <span class=\"italic\">t sound</span> is voiced and is pronounced like a quick <span class=\"italic\">d sound</span> when it occurs in the middle of a word after a vowel sound or <span class=\"italic\">r sound</span> and before a vowel sound."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: daughter, computer, settle"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Sound 3:  </span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The letter <span class=\"italic\">t</span> is the sound in the middle of the word when it follows a vowel, <span class=\"italic\">n sound</span>, or <span class=\"italic\">r sound</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: partner, certain, fitness"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class =\"strong\">Sound 4:</span>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "The letter <span class=\"italic\">t</span> is not always said when it follows an <span class=\"italic\">n sound</span> and is before a vowel sound, <span class=\"italic\">r sound</span>."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Examples: center, gentle, advantage"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "programming "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the act or job of creating computer programs "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Are you learning computer programing?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob04aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you hear in a conversation about work."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to contribute "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to help to cause something to happen "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: We have to contribute to online discussions."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob04aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overwhelming "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "used to describe something that is very confusing or difficult "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: All this work is a little overwhelming."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob04aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tell me about it"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to agree with something "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Tell me about it! Working and going to school is hard."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob04aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "to retire "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to stop working at a job or career because of age"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to retire before I turn 60."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob04aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "pay off"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to receive benefit for completion of work"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(expression)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I hope all this work pays off."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn5le10ob04aud06"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn5le10ob04re1img01.png"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Read the words in the table aloud with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Write 5 sentences about work or school."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Use 10 words from the table."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Find any difficult words in a dictionary."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Read the sentences with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Try to create a tongue twister!"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ankle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"uncle\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"back\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"buck\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"badge\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"budge\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bag\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bug\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"ban\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"bun\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"crash\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"crush\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"dabble \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"double\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I read the minimal pairs with a partner."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I write 5 sentences about jobs or school."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I read the sentences to a partner."}]}], "type": "sena"}